      "widgets_values": [
        "Edit this product photograph of one VELUNE Raspberry Ganache carton. Keep the box shape, camera angle, VELUNE wordmark, Raspberry Ganache flavour label, plum paperboard and the printed whole and cut chocolate exactly as in the input. Change the set and studio lighting around the carton. Keep it grounded with a believable contact shadow. One continuous product photograph. Do not add packaging, props, logos, claims or overlay text. Create a bold mobile-first social image using a saturated raspberry backdrop and a wide diagonal shaft of light that lands behind the carton. Brighten the set and add a crisp edge shadow. Keep the box front readable against the vivid backdrop, leave a calm area toward the upper left for separately typeset copy, and keep the carton fully in frame."
      ],
